Package: streamflowsignatures
Title: Streamflow Signature Extraction and Trend Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Arik", "Tashie", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "arikt@example.com")
Description: Extract 60+ hydrological signatures from daily streamflow data,
    including flow volumes, baseflow indices, recession parameters, pulse metrics,
    flow timing, flashiness, flow duration curves, runoff ratios, elasticity,
    Q-P seasonality, and average storage. Each signature produces 8 trend
    statistics (Theil-Sen slope, linear slope, Spearman correlation, Mann-Kendall
    test, mean, median). Mirrors the Python and Julia implementations for
    cross-language reproducibility.
